    "processing": "Imported from alto_map_piano_dynamic.sfz, alto_map_forte_dynamic.sfz with scripts/sfz-import.py: velocity layers first,last, up to 1 round robins, MIDI roots 0-127; mono, 22050 Hz, looped 1-2.5 s with a 300 ms crossfade; zone levels evened out (\u00b112 dB max); one gain for all files (peak -1 dBFS); 16-bit WAV. Added breath (6 regions, MTG Solo Saxophones breath noises, CC BY 4.0) with scripts/add-articulation.py, levelled -11.4 dB against the sustain. Added keys (6 regions, MTG Solo Saxophones key noises, CC BY 4.0) with scripts/add-articulation.py, levelled -8.3 dB against the sustain."
